  "fullDescription": "Pink Retro is a fun and cute, groovy font (Display soft and textured lettering).\n\nTake a groovy trip back in time with PINK RETRO! This fun, bouncy duo-style font captures the playful energy of the 1970s and 80s. Featuring thick, melted, and bubbly letterforms, the package includes both a smooth Solid version and a cool Grunge (textured/distressed) version for instant vintage character. Perfect for attention-grabbing headlines, cute branding, fashion, posters, and merchandise that needs a vibrant, nostalgic, and fun-loving look.\n\nThis font is perfect for children-themed, custom designs, DIY crafts, or just any creation that requires a lovely touch.",
